<h2 class="heading-size-2" id="body-armor">Body Armor for Arcane Mage DPS Phase 3</h2>
<h3 class="heading-size-3" id="head">Head for Arcane Mage DPS Phase 3</h3>The <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/item=47764/sunstriders-hood-of-triumph">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_helmet_102.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Sunstrider's Hood of Triumph</span></a> is best in slot, not only because of its high stats, but also due to the powerful set bonuses it can provide. Until you obtain the 258 ilvl version of T9, you should use <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/item=47771/sunstriders-hood-of-triumph">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_helmet_102.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Sunstrider's Hood of Triumph</span></a> (245 ilvl t9) version of the same item, this is significantly easier to obtain and should be considered as the baseline for this slot. As pure catch-up you can use <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/item=46129/conquerors-kirin-tor-hood">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_helmet_133.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Conqueror's Kirin Tor Hood</span></a> if you happen to obtain it as it can provide solid hit rating as well as tier 8 two-piece set bonus which will add to your initial burst phase.<div class="quote-box" data-has-source="false" data-type="user">
<div class="quote-header"></div>
<div class="quote-body" data-markup-content-target="1">
<b>Recommended BiS Helm Enchant</b>: <a class="q7 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/item=50368/arcanum-of-burning-mysteries">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/spell_fire_masterofelements.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Arcanum of Burning Mysteries</span></a>, requires Revered reputation with <a href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/faction=1090/kirin-tor">
<span class="tinyicontxt">Kirin Tor</span></a>.</div></div>
<div class="pad"></div>
<table class="grid max-width">
<tbody>
<tr>
