<h3 class="heading-size-3" id="chest">Chest for Arcane Mage DPS Phase 3</h3>The <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/item=47425/flowing-robes-of-ascent">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_chest_cloth_73.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Flowing Robes of Ascent</span></a> is less contested and performs slightly better, but you can use <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/item=47462/skyweaver-vestments">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_chest_cloth_64.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Skyweaver Vestments</span></a> assuming you can drop the hit elsewhere such as using <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/item=47518/mortalis">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_sword_137.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Mortalis</span></a> and <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/item=47995/scepter-of-imprisoned-souls">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_wand_31.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Scepter of Imprisoned Souls</span></a> instead of <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/item=47422/barb-of-tarasque">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_weapon_shortblade_93.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Barb of Tarasque</span></a> and <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/item=47922/rod-of-imprisoned-souls">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_wand_15.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Rod of Imprisoned Souls</span></a>. <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/item=47766/sunstriders-robe-of-triumph">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_chest_cloth_68.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Sunstrider's Robe of Triumph</span></a> can be a great item assuming you're using it for four-piece set bonus and using an off-piece elsewhere such as <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/item=45665/pharos-gloves">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_gauntlets_61.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Pharos Gloves</span></a>. The same applies to <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/item=47769/sunstriders-robe-of-triumph">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_chest_cloth_68.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Sunstrider's Robe of Triumph</span></a> to a lesser extent since it's likely to be a temporary upgrade more so than something to aim for long term. <br/>
<br/>The <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/item=47604/merlins-robe">
