<h3 class="heading-size-3" id="wrist">Wrist for Arcane Mage DPS Phase 3</h3>The <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/item=47485/bindings-of-the-ashen-saint">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_bracer_24b.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Bindings of the Ashen Saint</span></a> is best in slot, but this is less of a very small upgrade over <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/item=45446/grasps-of-reason">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_bracer_24b.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Grasps of Reason</span></a> (about 20 dps). That that into consideration when trying to obtain it. <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/item=47467/dark-essence-bindings">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_bracer_32a.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Dark Essence Bindings</span></a> is similar item level, but a lot weaker due to how its stats are distributed (approx 80 dps worse assuming best case scenario in terms of hit dropped on other slots). <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/item=47586/bejeweled-wizards-bracers">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_bracer_32a.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Bejeweled Wizard's Bracers</span></a> is now the new baseline item for this slot to get into raid, since it's a craftable BoE item, that's also only 35 dps worse than best in slot.<div class="quote-box" data-has-source="false" data-type="user">
