<h3 class="heading-size-3" id="hands">Hands for Arcane Mage DPS Phase 3</h3>The <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/item=47763/sunstriders-gauntlets-of-triumph">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_gauntlets_56.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Sunstrider's Gauntlets of Triumph</span></a> is best in slot, partially because of its high stats, and partially because it'll provide great value tier set bonuses. Right behind it is <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/item=47772/sunstriders-gauntlets-of-triumph">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_gauntlets_56.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Sunstrider's Gauntlets of Triumph</span></a> 245 ilvl version of tier 9 which will provide the same bonuses until you obtain the 258 ilvl version. <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/item=47773/sunstriders-gauntlets-of-conquest">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_gauntlets_56.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Sunstrider's Gauntlets of Conquest</span></a> 232 ilvl tier 9 is also an option, but only if you obtain it from <a href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/zone=4603/vault-of-archavon">
<span class="tinyicontxt">Vault of Archavon</span></a>, since buying this item will cost <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/item=47241/emblem-of-triumph">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/spell_holy_summonchampion.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Emblem of Triumph</span></a> that will then increase the time until you have the 245 version.<br/>
<br/>Alternatively you can use <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/item=45665/pharos-gloves">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_gauntlets_61.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Pharos Gloves</span></a> as a temporary off-piece assuming you're wearing tier 9 chest for four-piece tier 9 bonuses. This is 30 dps worse than the <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/item=47604/merlins-robe">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_chest_cloth_64.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Merlin's Robe</span></a> BoE chest as off-piece assuming four-piece tier 9 equipped in the remaining slots. Because of this I don't recommend it since it'll require tier chest which you should replace later anyways.<div class="quote-box" data-has-source="false" data-type="user">
