<h3 class="heading-size-3" id="legs">Legs for Arcane Mage DPS Phase 3</h3>
<a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/item=47765/sunstriders-leggings-of-triumph">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_pants_cloth_20.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Sunstrider's Leggings of Triumph</span></a> will now be the best leggings due to the powerful tier 9 set bonuses. Until you get the 258 ilvl version of tier 9, the <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/item=47770/sunstriders-leggings-of-triumph">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_pants_cloth_20.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Sunstrider's Leggings of Triumph</span></a> 245 ilvl is what you should aim for. Alternatively, there's also the 232 ilvl <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/item=47775/sunstriders-leggings-of-conquest">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_pants_cloth_20.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Sunstrider's Leggings of Conquest</span></a> which can help complete the set, I do not recommend buying this using <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/item=47241/emblem-of-triumph">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/spell_holy_summonchampion.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Emblem of Triumph</span></a> since that'll delay your 245 ilvl item, but if you happen to obtain it from <a href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/zone=4603/vault-of-archavon">
<span class="tinyicontxt">Vault of Archavon</span></a> - then there's no reason not to use it temporarily.<br/>
<br/>In terms of off-pieces, assuming you already have four-piece tier 9, there's not much of value here:<ul>
<li>
<div data-markup-content-target="1">
<a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/item=47435/pants-of-the-soothing-touch">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_pants_cloth_06.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Pants of the Soothing Touch</span></a> performs worse than both <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/item=45665/pharos-gloves">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_gauntlets_61.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Pharos Gloves</span></a> and <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/item=47604/merlins-robe">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_chest_cloth_64.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Merlin's Robe</span></a>.</div></li>
<li>
<div data-markup-content-target="1">
<a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/item=47478/breeches-of-the-deepening-void">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_pants_cloth_02.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Breeches of the Deepening Void</span></a> and <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/item=45488/leggings-of-the-enslaved-idol">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_pants_cloth_27.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Leggings of the Enslaved Idol</span></a> have too much hit assuming you have a basic set with tier 9 chest and head (148 to 172 hit depending on ilvl) meaning you'll have a ton of wasted value here.</div></li></ul>
