<h3 class="heading-size-3" id="feet">Feet for Arcane Mage DPS Phase 3</h3>
<a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/item=47454/sandals-of-the-mourning-widow">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_boots_cloth_23.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Sandals of the Mourning Widow</span></a> are the best boots this phase. If you happen to need Hit here, then <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/item=47482/boots-of-the-icy-floe">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_boots_cloth_17.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Boots of the Icy Floe</span></a> are better by 50 dps if you use <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/item=47518/mortalis">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_sword_137.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Mortalis</span></a> instead of <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/item=47422/barb-of-tarasque">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_weapon_shortblade_93.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Barb of Tarasque</span></a>. There's also <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/item=48012/sunreaver-magus-sandals">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_boots_cloth_17.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Sunreaver Magus' Sandals</span></a> which can help provide similar hit, but these output 170 dps less than the best in slot, making it not worthwhile assuming you can get it on other slots somehow.<br/>
<br/>Assuming you're hit capped regardless, then <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/item=45135/boots-of-fiery-resolution">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_boots_cloth_19.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Boots of Fiery Resolution</span></a> is the second best option, at only 20 dps difference from <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/item=47454/sandals-of-the-mourning-widow">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_boots_cloth_23.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Sandals of the Mourning Widow</span></a>. That's followed up by <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/item=45537/treads-of-the-false-oracle">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_boots_cloth_17.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Treads of the False Oracle</span></a>, these don't keep up as well at nearly 100 dps loss. This is because the spirit in <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/item=45135/boots-of-fiery-resolution">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_boots_cloth_19.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Boots of Fiery Resolution</span></a> gets additional value from the <a href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/item-set=-174/triumphant-khadgars-regalia">
<span class="tinyicontxt">Triumphant Khadgar's Regalia</span></a> two-set bonus that gets applied to <a class="icontiny" data-entity="spell" data-entity-has-icon="true" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/spell=43046/molten-armor">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/ability_mage_moltenarmor.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Molten Armor</span></a>. In this same category of item without hit, there's <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/item=49234/boots-of-the-grieving-soul">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_boots_cloth_23.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Boots of the Grieving Soul</span></a>, at nearly 200 dps loss versus best in slot.<br/>
<br/>
<a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/item=45566/spellslingers-slippers">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_boots_cloth_03.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Spellslinger's Slippers</span></a> should be considered as the baseline before entering raids.<div class="quote-box" data-has-source="false" data-type="user">
<div class="quote-header"></div>
<div class="quote-body" data-markup-content-target="1">
