<h3 class="heading-size-3" id="rings">Rings for Arcane Mage DPS Phase 3</h3>The <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/item=47489/lurid-manifestation">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_jewelry_ring_55.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Lurid Manifestation</span></a> and <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/item=45495/conductive-seal">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_jewelry_ring_66.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Conductive Seal</span></a> perform similarly. <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/item=46046/nebula-band">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_jewelry_ring_70.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Nebula Band</span></a> is very easy to obtain now in phase 3, and this is the next best option since it outputs only 50 dps less. If you're in need of a second ring to go alongside <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/item=46046/nebula-band">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_jewelry_ring_70.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Nebula Band</span></a> early on (and are already hit capped), then <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/item=47732/band-of-the-invoker">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_jewelry_ring_54.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Band of the Invoker</span></a> is your best option. Lastly, as for hit options here, in best conditions possible in terms of extra stats on other slots by getting hit here - you still lose 110 dps if you use <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/item=45297/shimmering-seal">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_jewelry_ring_63.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Shimmering Seal</span></a> and 160 dps with <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/item=48001/firestorm-band">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_jewelry_ring_57.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Firestorm Band</span></a>.<div class="quote-box" data-has-source="false" data-type="user">
<div class="quote-header"></div>
<div class="quote-body" data-markup-content-target="1">
<b>BiS Ring Enchant</b>: If you are an <span class="icontiny lazy-load-background" style='background-image: url("https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/trade_engraving.gif");'>Enchanter</span>- use <a class="icontiny" data-entity="spell" data-entity-has-icon="true" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/spell=44636/enchant-ring-greater-spellpower">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/trade_engraving.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Enchant Ring - Greater Spellpower</span></a>. This profession isn't recommended.</div></div>
