<h3 class="heading-size-3" id="trinkets">Trinkets for Arcane Mage DPS Phase 3</h3>The <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/item=47477/reign-of-the-dead">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_crown_13.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Reign of the Dead</span></a> is now mandatory for full best in slot as one of the two trinkets you'll use. With it ideally you use <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/item=45518/flare-of-the-heavens">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/spell_holy_summonlightwell.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Flare of the Heavens</span></a>. In comparison to <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/item=45518/flare-of-the-heavens">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/spell_holy_summonlightwell.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Flare of the Heavens</span></a>, there's <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/item=45490/pandoras-plea">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/achievement_dungeon_ulduar77_25man.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Pandora's Plea</span></a> which can perform within 50 dps lower output, or <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/item=45466/scale-of-fates">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_spiritshard_02.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Scale of Fates</span></a> which can range from 90 to upwards of 200 dps on a bad fight length for 2 min cooldowns.<br/>
<br/>
<a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/item=45308/eye-of-the-broodmother">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_misc_eye_02.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Eye of the Broodmother</span></a> will now be very easy to obtain from the new heroic dungeon difficulty, and is still only 150 dps worse than <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/item=45518/flare-of-the-heavens">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/spell_holy_summonlightwell.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Flare of the Heavens</span></a>. Making this an amazing early trinket to aim for alongside something like either <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/item=39229/embrace-of-the-spider">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_trinket_naxxramas04.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Embrace of the Spider</span></a> or <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/item=40682/sundial-of-the-exiled">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/ability_hunter_readiness.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Sundial of the Exiled</span></a>. Although far more awkward to use, you can also use either <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/item=45148/living-flame">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/spell_fire_burnout.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Living Flame</span></a> or <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/item=40255/dying-curse">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_trinket_naxxramas03.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Dying Curse</span></a> to fill any early hit gaps you might have temporarily.<div class="pad"></div>
