<h2 class="heading-size-2" id="weapons">Weapons for Arcane Mage DPS Phase 3</h2>
<div class="pad"></div>
<h4 class="heading-size-4" id="main-hand-and-two-handed-weapons-for-arcane-mage-dps-phase-3">Main-Hand and Two-Handed Weapons for Arcane Mage DPS Phase 3</h4>
<a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/item=47422/barb-of-tarasque">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_weapon_shortblade_93.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Barb of Tarasque</span></a> will now be the best in slot weapon most of the time, with <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/item=45620/starshard-edge">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_weapon_shortblade_92.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Starshard Edge</span></a> behind it by approx. 180 dps, assuming you need a similar amount of hit temporarily. In some cases where you're already hit-capped - <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/item=47518/mortalis">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_sword_137.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Mortalis</span></a> can outperform the two previously mentioned weapons. <br/>
<br/>Behind those, there are quite a few options. If you're fully hit capped with something like <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/item=47462/skyweaver-vestments">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_chest_cloth_64.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Skyweaver Vestments</span></a> as your off-piece, then the staves are great intermediary items until you obtain your best in slot weapons. By order of performance, <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/item=47525/sufferance">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_staff_102.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Sufferance</span></a>, <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/item=48036/illumination">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_staff_102.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Illumination</span></a>, <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/item=48045/perdition">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_staff_102.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Perdition</span></a>, <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/item=45886/icecore-staff">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_staff_94.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Icecore Staff</span></a>, and <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/item=45457/staff-of-endless-winter">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_staff_94.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Staff of Endless Winter</span></a> all perform between 200 to 300 dps from the best in slot setup. In the case of the last two, because of tier 9's two-set bonus the <a class="icontiny" data-entity="spell" data-entity-has-icon="true" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/spell=43046/molten-armor">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/ability_mage_moltenarmor.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Molten Armor</span></a> raising your baseline critical strike chance quite a bit also lowers the value of your critical strike rating, meaning haste will tend to have a higher value.<br/>
<br/>There are also a couple of main-hand weapons that can be useful. <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/item=48701/spellharvest">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_sword_137.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Spellharvest</span></a> is within 200 dps of <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/item=47422/barb-of-tarasque">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_weapon_shortblade_93.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Barb of Tarasque</span></a> assuming you supplement the required hit with a <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/item=40153/veiled-ametrine">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_jewelcrafting_gem_39.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Veiled Ametrine</span></a>. Lastly, <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/item=45990/fusion-blade">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_sword_132.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Fusion Blade</span></a> which serves a similar goal as a temporary item that will allow you to itemize on other slots similarly to when you finally obtain your best weapon.<div class="quote-box" data-has-source="false" data-type="user">
