<h4 class="heading-size-4" id="off-hand-weapons-for-arcane-mage-dps-phase-3">Off Hand Weapons for Arcane Mage DPS Phase 3</h4>
<a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/item=48032/lightbane-focus">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_offhand_stratholme_a_02.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Lightbane Focus</span></a> will be best in slot for Arcane, this is due to good stat distribution, having both haste and filling out your required hit quite nicely, assuming a full set scenario. If you're already hit-capped, then <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/item=47470/mystifying-charm">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_offhand_stratholme_a_02.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Mystifying Charm</span></a> is a great alternative, although not as good in terms of high end performance. <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/item=47470/mystifying-charm">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_offhand_stratholme_a_02.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Mystifying Charm</span></a> and <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/item=45617/cosmos">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_offhand_ulduarraid_d_03.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Cosmos</span></a> both provide hit, but are equipped with critical strike rating instead which somewhat loses value in comparison to haste this phase due to the <a class="icontiny" data-entity="spell" data-entity-has-icon="true" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/spell=43046/molten-armor">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/ability_mage_moltenarmor.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Molten Armor</span></a> buff that comes with tier 9 set bonuses giving so much extra critical strike rating. Lastly, there's <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/item=45115/leviathan-fueling-manual">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_offhand_ulduarraid_d_02.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Leviathan Fueling Manual</span></a> - which is a great early item that provides the same hit as <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/item=48032/lightbane-focus">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_offhand_stratholme_a_02.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Lightbane Focus</span></a> while also being fairly easy to obtain. This can allow for proper gear planning with best in slot in mind that later allows for a direct slot swap.<div class="pad"></div>
